'll tag you as the artist :) ) \n\nAlso could you please sepereate the layers or upload an additional .psd file (for annimation) + a version without background? ♥\n\nOC reference:\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1xPzeOUKObOk1x14lTxMMwUeN3Ml1TG-Z/view?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@oemmnn/works/11", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/eb78a90a/uploads/origins/099c8b8c-434a-47f6-a73b-fefa7b8e7ae0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7bbfa1221c3114fd82657b0de5144b4d", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/eb78a90a/uploads/origins/099c8b8c-434a-47f6-a73b-fefa7b8e7ae0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7bbfa1221c3114fd82657b0de5144b4d, https://si.imgix.net/eb78a90a/uploads/origins/099c8b8c-434a-47f6-a73b-fefa7b8e7ae0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=92ca5110d8aa07a7758ea0d0eb81f691 2x, https://si.imgix.net/eb78a90a/uploads/origins/099c8b8c-434a-47f6-a73b-fefa7b8e7ae0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f51e6c27c0de5b4dedc0a33458702cfc 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hi there, I really like your art style, I'd like to commission you to draw my Vtuber character.  My character design https://imgur.com/fP4qDzK. She is a cute, bubbly and hyper bunny Vtuber. Breast size is medium to large, do not draw her flat please. I really like the way you draw this Skeb https://skeb.jp/@oemmnn/works/8 I would like similar laying down pose either on bed or couch with light pink background. Please have my character holding a chicken nugget instead. You can pick the expression. \nPlease separate background, and character since I may use this as my BRB screen. I intend to use this on my Twitch, Twitter, Youtube and other social media. I will leave full credit to you. Thank you very much for your consideration!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@oemmnn/works/1